<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
  Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset the Tally password for <%= @user.email %>.
</p>
<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
  <a href="<%= edit_password_reset_url(token: @token) %>">Choose a new password</a> — the link works for 30 minutes.
</p>
<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">
  If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email; your password won't change.
</p>
